{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_031_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d10380c9a6f0f978655d93b8ab9fcc15e0e4d8ab43a0c313d7cbceaae25fc5fa",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_23:5_01_031_23_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8807650d99f31ca0803d4b7b9b15fac3d06f086cef4f0df8a67aac3f2f4c6356",
      "text": "早上好，制作人！\n能在大早晨就遇上你真是太好了～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_23:5_01_031_23_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7560d08e07663f99f592aae4f4dbdd5be76eacf476f0ac19536629b8353e04e",
      "text": "当当——！这个，是情人节礼物！\n今年我也准备了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_23:5_01_031_23_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ad076c052dd325debc4ae687f1ee5fdce0cebcebb97dcc3d142eb4d85eebd3f",
      "text": "因为想快点送给制作人，\n我就急急忙忙赶过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_23:5_01_031_23_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a93c98e4c7f68b484e62faa8bf29ada0078028e404f51b230b62b4f98e44dea1",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n这是，巧克力和……笔袋吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_23:5_01_031_23_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e10e471dcae802fea7120cffe7ef8ec700add55dd9ed8c876ce94e8db98bc359",
      "text": "对哦♪我觉得除了巧克力之外，要是还有能留在\n手边的东西就太好啦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_23:5_01_031_23_a:cmd-000048:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fbd2b20a9182b9d420dafa8f02b6c9c07cd52ac6cdfc5c762f0b498972758c3",
      "text": "很棒的设计呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_23:5_01_031_23_a:cmd-000049:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aba8cfbe4d0b7f8947081c8fdfb3ed3839b7674aa5367650c9f922705be5e40e",
      "text": "看起来很好用，真高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_23:5_01_031_23_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa932ee84bb21fd108a02893ef6aba469d9c67c528bedca8c2cd5fd1df4dfbe9",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿，你能喜欢真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_23:5_01_031_23_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ba9758314f62685029a08d0dca0ed059335722ee9e5f5c4a494f4675dfd8bfa",
      "text": "其实呢，\n那个笔袋，是我亲手做的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_23:5_01_031_23_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17d79509176ac644377caa35dcba8f7622d7622687330e897ec5bd410ea5c958",
      "text": "我在想怎样才能把心意传达得更好呢，\n于是就决定亲手制作啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_031_23:5_01_031_23_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc380138fb79703df8940f48541cc0963a8d8470412a0ee51476a977f1988676",
      "text": "制作人，一直以来谢谢你！\n今天一整天，也要元气满满地加油哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
